{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"269eaab6dd268371b8f73f067e7d46a9d41a29930d2a2303d86458bda06c14ce","ja":"ふふっ。この子、人懐っこいわね～。\nここを撫でると……ほら、気持ちよさそう♪","zh":"呵呵，这孩子真亲人呢～  \n摸摸这里的话……你看，好像很舒服♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"34c84b9060403bb8a02ae5ce03f71f8fa3595d7d97fa8b4af30832e5cd98da45","ja":"こっちの子はちょー元気だよ！\nさっきからお店の中、走り回ってるもんね！","zh":"这孩子可有精神了！从刚才开始就在店里跑来跑去呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e23063ec28ca8b96780ed3e3a9e50bb4a4b8ed1c4c36733619dfd2e275fafd69","ja":"ふふっ、本当。\nまるで真美ちゃんみたいかも。なんて♪","zh":"呵呵，真的呢。\n说不定就像真美一样吧。开玩笑的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7d32f7b0d9412117900afc8aa174967164a69a402b51ee53fc34f242d9f5dbfa","ja":"本当！？　この子、真美に似てる？\nペットは飼い主に似るってよく言いますからなぁ♪","zh":"真的！？这孩子和真美很像？  \n常听人说，宠物像主人呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"60ae320f323091378d83a072f7b5320da7770a4e292d99a5b304db065119a4e2","ja":"ウフフ、すっかり飼い主気分ね。\nところで……雪歩ちゃんは大丈夫かしら？","zh":"呵呵，已经完全有当主人的感觉了呢。  \n对了……雪步没事吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_922.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4d42ce1c68abf6ea6be978d55c38fe6b91ad403646f85d7a2fe50d551b9f4a08","ja":"だ、大丈夫じゃないですぅ……。\nわっ！　一匹こっちに……こ、来ないでぇ～！","zh":"不、不太行了……。\n哇！有一只朝这边……别、别过来啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
